+# (0172) The one-time read-only shop probe: a FRAME_STEP cut at the list
+# NrvDecide confirm point, 0x2e8dfc `mov x22, x0` (original word
+# 0xaa0003f6 -- the bytes at 0x2e8dfc in the decompressed 1.4.1 NSO are
